    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Don't Breathe In&quot;</strong> offers a thrilling survival-horror experience that traps you in a dark and dangerous laboratory. Your mission is to investigate the evacuated facility after a failed experiment caused an explosion while avoiding exposure to toxic gas. The only way out is to solve puzzles and find a way to escape the deadly atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: <strong>Every breath you take brings you closer to death...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Psychological Horror &amp; Thriller</strong> \u2013 Face a tense atmosphere, unexpected scares, and an unknown threat.<br>\u2714 <strong>Puzzle Solving &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Unlock doors and discover survival paths using your intelligence.<br>\u2714 <strong>Limited Resources</strong> \u2013 Your time and breath are restricted. Choose wisely, or you may never leave this lab.<br>\u2714 <strong>Dark &amp; Atmospheric Graphics</strong> \u2013 A realistic horror experience with low lighting and an immersive sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you survive? Or will this laboratory become your eternal grave?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Don't Breathe In&quot;</strong> offers a thrilling survival-horror experience that traps you in a dark and dangerous laboratory. Your mission is to investigate the evacuated facility after a failed experiment caused an explosion while avoiding exposure to toxic gas. The only way out is to solve puzzles and find a way to escape the deadly atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: <strong>Every breath you take brings you closer to death...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Psychological Horror &amp; Thriller</strong> \u2013 Face a tense atmosphere, unexpected scares, and an unknown threat.<br>\u2714 <strong>Puzzle Solving &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Unlock doors and discover survival paths using your intelligence.<br>\u2714 <strong>Limited Resources</strong> \u2013 Your time and breath are restricted. Choose wisely, or you may never leave this lab.<br>\u2714 <strong>Dark &amp; Atmospheric Graphics</strong> \u2013 A realistic horror experience with low lighting and an immersive sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you survive? Or will this laboratory become your eternal grave?</strong></p>",
